   "title": "Workaround: Duplicate Records and Garbled Characters in Tax Calculator Exports",
   "content_summary": "Addresses issues where Tax Calculator exports contain duplicate records and garbled characters due to an idempotency failure. Includes a known-issue workaround and queue reprocessing steps.",
